   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about the neighbourhood",
     "texto": [
      "**Nabolag** is neighbourhood; **språkgruppe**, a language conversation or practice group. **Hverandre** means «each other»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about goals",
     "texto": [
      "**For å + infinitivo** expresses purpose: **Jeg deltar for å øve** («I take part in order to practise»). **Trygg** can mean «safe» or «confident»; in **tryggere når jeg snakker** it means «more confident when I speak»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
